# Find the first bad beat
@scenario office_lesson_12
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Someone reported a broken pose. Find the exact line so your teammate can reproduce it.
pip: Change a single pose on one line. Run from that line, then run through it from the opening.
@label check
pip: Which report makes a timing bug reproducible?
> A screenshot of the project folder. -> retry
> The script, source line and exact preceding choice. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: The same state and cursor give the reviewer a repeatable starting point. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: The same state and cursor give the reviewer a repeatable starting point.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_12]
[flag tutorial_done_12]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
